# Copy this file to ".env.local" to change how the site runs on your computer.
# Without it the site still works: data is kept in memory and resets when you stop the server.

# Use a real MongoDB database, so orders and stock survive a restart:
# MONGODB_URI=mongodb://localhost:27017/localrush

# Signs the login cookie. Any long random text.
# SESSION_SECRET=change-me-to-a-long-random-string

# Google's real 3D map of your location, with the real shops near you. Needs "Maps JavaScript
# API" and "Places API (New)" switched on for the key (see README, "Real 3D map").
# Without it the home page shows LocalRush's own 3D scene. Restart "npm run dev" after changing it.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your-key-here
